        "q_what_is": "What is Cravvy?",
        "a_what_is": "Cravvy is an AI cooking assistant app designed for health-conscious users. It suggests personalized menus based on your health goals, helping eliminate the daily \"what should I eat?\" dilemma.",
        "q_free": "Is Cravvy free?",
        "a_free": "Yes! Cravvy operates on a Freemium model. The Free plan allows 3 meal suggestions per day. Premium unlocks full AI features, 7–30 day plans and the AI Nutrition Chatbot.",
        "q_diets": "Does Cravvy support all diets?",
        "a_diets": "Cravvy supports many diets: Unrestricted, Eat Clean, Vegan, Vegetarian, Keto, Paleo, Mediterranean, Gluten-Free, and Dairy-Free. You can change your diet preference anytime in Settings.",
        "q_data": "Is my data safe?",
        "a_data": "Personal information is encrypted and never shared with third parties. You can export or delete all your data anytime in Settings → Privacy.",
        "q_ai_suggest": "How does AI suggest meals?",
        "a_ai_suggest": "Cravvy's AI analyzes your personal info (height, weight, health goal, diet, food allergies) to generate the most suitable menu.",
        "q_swap": "How does Meal Swap work?",
        "a_swap": "Meal Swap lets you replace any meal in your plan with another that matches the same calories — in one tap. Free gets 2 swaps/week; Premium is unlimited.",
        "q_chatbot": "What is the AI Nutrition Chatbot?",
        "a_chatbot": "The AI Nutrition Chatbot (Premium) answers questions like \"What should I eat to build muscle?\" instantly, based on verified nutritional data.",
        "q_cancel": "How do I cancel my subscription?",
        "a_cancel": "You can cancel anytime from Settings → Subscription → Manage Plan. Your Premium access remains active until the end of the current billing period.",
        "q_change_email": "Can I change my email or password?",
        "a_change_email": "Yes. Go to Profile → Edit Profile to update your name or email. To change your password, go to Settings → Change Password.",
        "q_delete": "What happens to my data if I delete my account?",
        "a_delete": "Deleting your account permanently erases all your personal data, meal history, and preferences. You can export your data first via Settings → Export My Data.",
        "q_offline": "Does Cravvy work offline?",
        "a_offline": "Saved recipes and your meal plan are available offline. AI suggestions, Meal Swap, and the Nutrition Chatbot require an internet connection.",
        "q_bug": "How do I report a bug?",
        "a_bug": "Use Settings → Help & Feedback to submit a bug report. Our team typically responds within 24 hours."
